<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.6">
<l>kāṇpateñ ñāṉṟukolō viṉaiyēṉkaṉi vāymaṭavīr</l>
<l>pāṇkural vaṇṭiṉōṭu pacunteṉṟalu mākiyeṅkuñ</l>
<l>cēṇciṉai yōṅkumarac ceḻuṅkāṉaṟ ṟiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>māṇkuṟaḷ kōlappirāṉ malarttāmaraip pātaṅkaḷē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Which day will I with [bad] Karma see, o women with fruit mouths,</l>
<l>the flowering lotus feet of the beautiful lord, glorious dwarf</l>
<l>from Tiruvallavāḻ with seashore groves rich in high trees with far branches</l>
<l>everywhere, there being the fresh south wind too with bees with melodious voices?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
